{
  "slug": "venture-capital-intelligence",
  "name": "Venture Capital Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "9 skills for venture capital intelligence. 3 run on pure Claude reasoning. 6 run Claude + Python for deterministic outputs — screening startups, modeling financials, sizing markets, computing cap table waterfalls, scanning deal signals, and generating LP fund reports. Built from the best open-source VC tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `analyze-pitch-deck` (Activate for ANY pitch deck analysis, feedback, or review request), `cap-table-waterfall` (Model cap table dilution, SAFE conversion, and exit waterfall across scenarios), `deal-sourcing-signals` (Scan a company or sector for deal-sourcing signals across 6 dimensions), `explain-equity-terms` (Activate for ANY equity, legal, or term sheet question related to startup investing or fundraising), `financial-model` (Run deterministic financial models for startup valuation and SaaS health analysis), `fund-operations` (Compute fund KPIs (TVPI, DPI, IRR, MOIC), model carried interest and management fees, and generate LP quarterly update…), `hard-screening-startup` (Deterministic Python-scored startup screening with full audit trail), `market-size` (Run TAM/SAM/SOM market sizing with top-down and bottom-up methods, competitive landscape, and tech stack analysis), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install venture-capital-intelligence@claude-community` from `isanthoshgandhi/venture-capital-intelligence`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
